// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P2864456211" "<em crossarms t=4 d=4>{HeroName} I should've figured that Justin would send you."
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3748942059" "<em t=4 d=4>I was like you, once. Until Justin tried to kill me. As you can see, it didn't take."
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P2236344163" "<em no t=4 d=4>He wants you to capture me, but I'm here to give you a different offer, and some insight..."
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P4243932008" "<em slashthroat t=4 d=4>Once you become a threat, Justin will kill you, just as he has done to so many others in the past."
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3539014159" "<em welcome t=4 d=4>Join with me and the Resistance, and we will give you more power than you could ever dream of!"
// 4 Loyalist_Leader :
"P1679041228" "<em t=4 d=4>And... unlike Justin, we won't try to kill you when you get too powerful. What do you say, {HeroName}?"
// LeftText :
"P2365533992" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Join with Belladonna</color></scale><br>Accept Belladonna's Offer of Power</span><br><br><color Paragon>Aid the Resistance</color><br>Perhaps Belladonna's words are true. You've certaintly experienced how controlling Praetor Sinclair is; almost every single action you've taken in dealing with Project Phoenix has been set by him. Is it worth it to have great power if Sinclair is using you as his puppet? Save Belladonna and see just where the power that the Resistance offers will take you!<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P363052781" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Take Down Belladonna</color></scale><br>Capture Belladonna for Sinclair</span><br><br><color orange>Aid the Loyalists</color><br>It's true that Sinclair may be controlling, but he's not going to control you. Belladonna's offer is interesting, but in the end, what power can the Resistance truly offer? They dwell in caves and fight a war they cannot win. Bring in Belladonna, earn your fame, and then you can break away from Sinclair. Nobody controls you - not the Resistance, not Sinclair!<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"

